<title>USA: Read-Rite trades in line with close.</title>
<headline>Read-Rite trades in line with close.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Read-Rite Corp traded in line with the closing price of 32-3/4 in after-hours trading on Tuesday, traders said.</p>
<p>A trader said there were much lower bids in after-hours trading, but the stock kept its gains for the day.</p>
<p>Applied Magnetics Corp said that it was committed to a takeover bid of Read-Rite, which had adopted a poison pill to thwart the bid.</p>
<p>Read-Rite gained two points on the Nasdaq on trading of 2.7 million shares, compared with a daily average of about 3.25 million shares.</p>
